{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MyDiscord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a fantasy rogue-like action game where you select a faction from the Alliance, Orcs, Undead, and Demons, gather your heroes and armies to march onto the battlefield, carve a bloody path in a turbulent world, conquer territories and defeat opponents, and ultimately become the overlord of the land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a fast-paced and thrilling third-person fantasy action game that provides a massive melee experience, integrating elements of construction, tower defense, roguelike, social interaction, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heroes and Armies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have four completely different factions to choose from, each with multiple heroes who have unique skill trees based on their positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your forces include tank infantry, assault infantry, ranged units, magical units, flying units, cavalry, and monster infantry, among others! \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\u2728 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/OrcBattle1-20230528.gif?t=1746788264\" />You will experience intense and brutal map encounters, siege battles, city defense battles, and more, and this game fully supports SteamDeck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/OrcHero1-20230528.gif?t=1746788264\" /><strong>Defense</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must protect your resources and important buildings and can establish enough defense works on your fortress to do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reasonable Management</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will manage your own fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/HumanHero1-20230528.gif?t=1746788264\" /><strong>Player Interaction</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can scout the fortress layout or attack the fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random World</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every game starts at a randomly generated special point on a random map, providing a fresh experience every time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2378010?t=1746788264","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2378010?t=1746788264","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/793bea630ffd9b6ec63b5f48e09644f9046f6910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746788264","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/793bea630ffd9b6ec63b5f48e09644f9046f6910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746788264","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MyDiscord: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a fantasy rogue-like action game where you select a faction from the Alliance, Orcs, Undead, and Demons, gather your heroes and armies to march onto the battlefield, carve a bloody path in a turbulent world, conquer territories and defeat opponents, and ultimately become the overlord of the land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a fast-paced and thrilling third-person fantasy action game that provides a massive melee experience, integrating elements of construction, tower defense, roguelike, social interaction, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heroes and Armies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have four completely different factions to choose from, each with multiple heroes who have unique skill trees based on their positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epic Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your forces include tank infantry, assault infantry, ranged units, magical units, flying units, cavalry, and monster infantry, among others! \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\u2728 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/OrcBattle1-20230528.gif?t=1746788264\" />You will experience intense and brutal map encounters, siege battles, city defense battles, and more, and this game fully supports SteamDeck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/OrcHero1-20230528.gif?t=1746788264\" /><strong>Defense</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must protect your resources and important buildings and can establish enough defense works on your fortress to do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reasonable Management</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will manage your own fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/extras/HumanHero1-20230528.gif?t=1746788264\" /><strong>Player Interaction</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can scout the fortress layout or attack the fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random World</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every game starts at a randomly generated special point on a random map, providing a fresh experience every time.</p>","developers":["COCOLAUGH STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2378010/c1e252d0d3ccde1c52952b0a6f181fd842f7dbcd/header.jpg?t=1746788264","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257132584,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132584/movie480.mp4?t=1746602709","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132584/movie_max.mp4?t=1746602709"},"name":"\u82f1\u96c4\u4e0e\u9738\u4e3bHeroes And Overlord  \u6218\u4e89\u6e38\u620f\u8282","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257132584/7787faeaf15191f2f934caf1f38561c0186c98be/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746602709","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132584/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746602709","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257132584/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746602709"}}],"name":"Heroes and Overlord","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 @ 2.80 GHz / AMD FX-4350 @ 4.2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 